[{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32000400_03_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32000400_03_0010","text":"────透\n今天一天，辛苦了"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32000400_03_0011","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32000400_03_0020","text":"嗯——\n请点单——"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32000400_03_0030","text":"哈哈，店员的工作已经结束了哦"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32000400_03_0031","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32000400_03_0040","text":"肚子饿了吧\n──请点单——"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32000400_03_0050","text":"哦……可以吗，那就──\n这个季节限定的汉堡和可乐……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32000400_03_0060","text":"再来一份老样子的透"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32000400_03_0070","text":"老样子？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32000400_03_0080","text":"──做了那么多笑容，累了吧？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32000400_03_0090","text":"啊——\n……那就，最后一个"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32000400_03_0091","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32000400_03_0100","text":"仅限制作人"}]
